{"t":"Pot of Blackjack","s":"pot-of-blackjack-a11a4","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Pot_of_Blackjack_1a1f90.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Pot of Blackjack</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Pot of Blackjack\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pot_of_Blackjack_1a1f90.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cooldown</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10 minutes</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0 seconds<br/><small>(0% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.60<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 30, 2010<br/>Summer Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20210713213522&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pot_of_Blackjack_1a1f90.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a pot of blackjack.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 12.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Nomads state that this meal fills you with energy several times before the pot is empty.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Gulp.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It heals 5000 HP instantly. Can be used 4 times.\n</p><p>When using this item the first 3 times, the user will get the following message: \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You take a gulp from the large bowl, but there's still some blackjack in it.</span>\" At the fourth time, the user will get: \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You take the last gulp from the large bowl. No leftovers!</span>\" and the item disappears. Green Sparkles Effect <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Green Sparkles Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Sparkles_Effect_f26b9f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> will always appear on the character that uses a Pot of Blackjack, regardless of whether it's the Pot's first, second, third, or fourth use.\n</p><p>The \"charges\" of this item are actually saved on the character as a counter, not on the item (as is the case with rings and amulets). This means that it is always safe to buy them from the market (and selling will not reset the charges), and it does not matter if you have more than one, because using either one will add to the character's count the same way.\n</p><p>To create this dish you must speak with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Djinn\">Djinn</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Jean%20Pierre\">Jean Pierre</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, near the Marid Fortress, during the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine</a> event. The cooldown is shared with all other <a href=\"#/wiki/Jean%20Pierre\">Jean Pierre</a> dishes as well as with all Hireling dishes, but not with Cupcakes.\n</p><p><b>Necessary Ingredients:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Sandcrawler%20Shell\">Sandcrawler Shells</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandcrawler%20Shell\"><img alt=\"Sandcrawler Shell\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sandcrawler_Shell_13dcad.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">Vials</a> of <a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20%28Liquid%29\">Water</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Water\"><img alt=\"Water\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Water_65826e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>20 <a href=\"#/wiki/Carrot\">Carrots</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Carrot\"><img alt=\"Carrot\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Carrot_2667e2.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Potato\">Potatoes</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Potato\"><img alt=\"Potato\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Potato_aaaae8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>3 Jalapeño Peppers <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Jalapeño Pepper\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jalapeno_Pepper_02db27.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></li></ul>\n<p>Obtainable through the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>The dish is one of the four winning recipes of the Gourmet Competition held by CipSoft in May 2010. The creator of this recipe is Karolak, formally known as <i>Adray Del'Impro</i>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Carrot\">Carrot</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Potato\">Potato</a></li><li>Regeneration</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandcrawler\">Sandcrawler</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandcrawler%20Shell\">Sandcrawler Shell</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Terofar\">Terofar</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">Vial</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Water%20%28Liquid%29\">Water (Liquid)</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["hot-cuisine-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"3-1","n":19,"title":"Prato 12: Blackjack","kind":"reward","coords":[{"x":33068,"y":32531,"z":6,"label":"Jean Pierre"}]},{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"4-0","n":24,"title":"Efeitos dos pratos","kind":"reward","coords":[]}]}}